      "cat-harness:section": "Foreground non-blocking delegation & research-agent niche continuity (STRICT)",
      "prov:value": "Owner directives, 2026-11-28: (1) even in foreground discussion mode, any investigation exceeding ~15-20 s dispatches a background research/analysis agent immediately so the foreground stays open for user input, reporting scope, ETA, potential outcomes + implications, and any structured clarification card up front; (2) *\"updates skills: if you have queue of research agents, generally keep them researching deep into niche topic areas. so related questions go to same agent. occasionally, if hints of cross-fertilization, ask questions of multiple agents to see if connections can be made\"*; (3) research agents execute the five-step evidence-gathering, multi-database retrieval, KG ingestion, relevancy assessment, and authoring-provenance workflow.",
